          "headline": "Kelce joins a club of four at Arrowhead",
          "text": "On Sunday against Arizona, Travis Kelce is set to become only the fourth player in Chiefs history to play 100 regular-season games at Arrowhead Stadium, joining Will Shields, Nick Lowery and Dustin Colquitt, according to ESPN. His Chiefs teams have won 76.5% of their games there, including 16 playoff wins.",
