          "headline": "Gauthier's goal streak hits 10, first since Selanne in 1997",
          "text": "Anaheim's Cutter Gauthier scored a hat trick in an 8-6 loss at St. Louis, extending his goal streak to 10 games. The AP says he is the first NHL player to score in 10 straight games since Teemu Selanne's 11-game run for Anaheim in 1997, the team record. He has 19 goals during the streak and is tied with Leon Draisaitl for the league lead with 21.",
