          "headline": "A game-winner in his NHL debut, for a goalie's son",
          "text": "Ottawa's Tyler Boucher, the 10th pick in the 2021 draft, scored the winning goal in his NHL debut as the Senators beat Winnipeg 2-1. His father, Brian Boucher, played 328 regular-season games in goal for seven NHL teams from 1999 to 2013. Winnipeg's 18-year-old Viggo Bjorck scored his first NHL goal in his 22nd game.",
